{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10039","headline":"奉试冷井诗 · 孙欣","name":"奉试冷井诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙闱井初凿，灵液沁成泉。\n色湛青苔里，寒凝紫绠边。\n铜瓶向影落，玉甃抱虚圆。\n永愿调神鼎，尧时泰万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙欣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}